\f0\b role relevance 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  meaningful temporal distinction 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  catalog/approval newness 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  stable technical fallback 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  Admin diagnostic
